{"id": "3189147", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3189147", "title": "Federa\u021bia Mondial\u0103 a Inimii", "text": "Federa\u021bia Mondial\u0103 a Inimii (\u00een ; acronim WHF) este o organiza\u021bie neguvernamental\u0103 cu sediul \u00een Geneva, Elve\u021bia, \u00eenfiin\u021bat\u0103 \u00een 1978. WHF este recunoscut\u0103 de Organiza\u021bia Mondial\u0103 a S\u0103n\u0103t\u0103\u021bii ca partener principal al ONG-ului \u00een prevenirea bolilor cardiovasculare."}
